  <p>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;">For more information about the Travel Coin Project and how to be a part of the tourism industry revolution, please visit – </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">https://tcoin.one</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">. The revolution also continues across social media, including </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">Telegram</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">, </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">Twitter</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">, and </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">YouTube</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span>
